<img alt="Brutalist architectural gallery space" class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale contrast-125 group-hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500" data-alt="Brutalist architectural interior with raw concrete walls, minimalist neon directional typography signage, geometric stairs, harsh architectural shadows." src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuC8IONlECFAgUjRUmAjRSRcrTPIwZJ0vk02NMZtgQBIViPJm_ocigxbthPqH4Vvcj6nvGs-XO2VkmkOHtS3hnL4-6KooSYHBH9o__fveB8IYZIYCSenfTQRXkKvxlmBZGQoCLf4XeoI_5B4veC5thZ_pSUgghrcIkUYBqTXZKCaUUV0y6Kyl7-xQvFLGnTlvCILBarg_YlSjzqx7-H0QYpnt667vyPS9jmyO0TYHnbe"/>
<div class="absolute top-2 left-2 bg-[#1a1a1a] text-[#ffcc00] font-headline font-black text-[9px] px-1.5 py-0.5 border border-[#1a1a1a]">
