          </div>
</div>
<div class="sm:col-span-7 p-3 sm:p-4 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-2">
<div>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] font-headline font-bold text-neutral-500">
<span>發案方：KRONOS ARCHITECTURE</span>
<span>剩餘 4 天截止</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-headline font-black text-base text-[#1a1a1a] leading-tight mt-1">
            新粗獷主義展覽空間導視與立體標籤系統
          </h3>
<p class="font-body text-xs text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed font-medium mt-1">
            結合冷軋鋼板、絲網印刷與幾何路徑規劃，為當代藝術雙年展量身建構空間指引系統手冊。
          </p>
</div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 flex-wrap pt-1">
<span class="bg-[#f5f0e8] text-[#1a1a1a] border border-[#1a1a1a] text-[9px] font-headline font-bold px-1.5 py-0.5">#空間指標</span>
<span class="bg-[#f5f0e8] text-[#1a1a1a] border border-[#1a1a1a] text-[9px] font-headline font-bold px-1.5 py-0.5">#材質打樣</span>
<span class="bg-[#f5f0e8] text-[#1a1a1a] border border-[#1a1a1a] text-[9px] font-headline font-bold px-1.5 py-0.5">#雙年展</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Full Width Footer Split Bar -->
<div class="flex">
<div class="bg-[#ffcc00] px-4 py-2 border-r-3 border-[#1a1a1a] flex flex-col justify-center min-w-[130px]">
<span class="font-headline font-black text-[8px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#1a1a1a] leading-none mb-0.5">專案預算</span>
<span class="font-headline font-black text-sm text-[#1a1a1a] leading-none">NT$ 150,000</span>
</div>
<button class="flex-1 bg-[#ff3f3f] text-white hover:bg-[#1a1a1a] active:opacity-90 px-3 py-2 font-headline font-black text-xs uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 transition-colors select-none" type="button">
<span>投遞提案</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">arrow_forward</span>
</button>
</div>
</article>
</div>
</section>
<!-- 3. Client Bottom Poster Banner -->
<section class="mt-2 bg-[#ffcc00] border-4 border-[#1a1a1a] shadow-[5px_5px_0px_#1a1a1a] p-3.5 relative overflow-hidden">
<div class="absolute -right-5 -bottom-5 w-20 h-20 bg-white border-3 border-[#1a1a1a] rotate-12 pointer-events-none opacity-40"></div>
<div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col gap-2.5">
<div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
<div class="w-9 h-9 bg-[#1a1a1a] text-[#ffcc00] border-2 border-[#1a1a1a] flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">post_add</span>
</div>
<div>
<span class="font-headline font-black text-[9px] tracking-widest text-[#1a1a1a] uppercase bg-white px-1.5 py-0.2 border border-[#1a1a1a]">
          FOR CLIENTS
        </span>
<h3 class="font-headline font-black text-sm text-[#1a1a1a] uppercase mt-0.5 leading-snug">
          我是品牌/客戶，想要刊登新委託？
        </h3>
<p class="font-body text-[11px] text-[#1a1a1a] font-medium leading-tight mt-0.5">
          全台 3,500+ 位通過認證的頂尖粗獷與前衛設計師即刻為您報價。
        </p>
</div>
</div>
<button class="w-full bg-[#ff3f3f] hover:bg-[#1a1a1a] text-white border-3 border-[#1a1a1a] shadow-[3px_3px_0px_#1a1a1a] active:translate-x-0.5 active:translate-y-0.5 px-3 py-2 font-headline font-black text-xs uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 transition-all" type="button">
<span>刊登全新專案委託</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">add_circle</span>
</button>
</div>
</section>
</div>
</main>
<!-- Bottom Navigation Bar with Bauhaus Style & Active Commission Tab -->
<nav class="fixed bottom-0 w-full z-50 pb-safe bg-[#f5f0e8]/95 backdrop-blur-md border-t-4 border-[#1a1a1a]">
<div class="flex items-center justify-around h-16 px-2">
<a class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center min-w-[64px] h-12 text-[#1a1a1a] hover:text-[#ff3f3f] transition-colors" data-path="explore-feed" href="#">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">home</span>
<span class="text-[11px] font-headline font-bold tracking-tight mt-0.5">首頁</span>
</a>
<!-- Active Tab: Commission List (Highlighted with Red/Yellow Neo-Brutalist Badge) -->
<a aria-current="page" class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center min-w-[70px] h-12 bg-[#ff3f3f] text-white border-2 border-[#1a1a1a] shadow-[2px_2px_0px_#1a1a1a]" data-path="commission-list" href="#">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[22px] text-[#ffcc00]" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">handshake</span>
<span class="text-[11px] font-headline font-black tracking-tight mt-0.5 text-white">委託</span>
</a>
<a class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center min-w-[64px] h-12 text-[#1a1a1a] hover:text-[#ff3f3f] transition-colors" data-path="messages" href="#">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">mail</span>
<span class="text-[11px] font-headline font-bold tracking-tight mt-0.5">訊息</span>
</a>
<a class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center min-w-[64px] h-12 text-[#1a1a1a] hover:text-[#ff3f3f] transition-colors" data-path="user-profile" href="#">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">person</span>
<span class="text-[11px] font-headline font-bold tracking-tight mt-0.5">個人</span>
</a>
</div>
</nav>
</body></html>